DeepSeek Balance Monitor notices
================================

Icon asset
----------

`assets/deepseek_icon.ico` is original project artwork created with OpenAI's built-in image generation.
The generation prompt asked for a simple, high-contrast desktop utility icon:
a cyan-blue balance gauge crossed by a clean data pulse on a removable solid-color
background, with no text, brand mark, or DeepSeek logo.
Post-processing removed the chroma background and used Pillow to convert
the transparent artwork into ICO frames at 16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 128, and 256
pixels. The project claims rights only in this original asset and its edits.

